    "chunk_text": "\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t wurld, & gew\u00e6nde\u00f0 heora lif to drohtnunga for heora Manega synden \u00fee beginne\u00f0 god to donne, & eft hit forl\u00e6te\u00f0, & gecerre\u00f0 to \u00fean yfele. Of swylce mannen is gewriten \u00fe\u00e6t heo gr\u00e6mige\u00f0 God. On swylcen wisen \u00feegne\u00f0 se deofol ure Drihtene. Hwu \u00feegne\u00f0 he him? For he nolde beon mid uren Drihtene on wuldre mid wele & mid blisse buten geswynce, \u00fea geaf God \u00dea hameres & \u00fea beliges synden \u00fea costninga, \u00fea tangen synden ehteres, \u00fea fielen & \u00fea sagen synd \u00deurh swylcne smi\u00f0 & \u00feurh swylce tol, gecl\u00e6nsa\u00f0 ure Drihten \u00fe\u00e6re halgena sawlen, ac of \u00fean yfela Hwy synden \u00fea ly\u00f0ere m\u00e6n swa welige on wurlde, & habbe\u00f0 of heore wille genoh, & \u00fea gode m\u00e6nn Eall \u00fe\u00e6t is for \u00fean gode mannen, \u00fe\u00e6t heo ascunigen & lytel tellen & unwur\u00f0 of \u00fean wele \u00fee \u00fea yfela Hwy is eft \u00fe\u00e6t sum god mann h\u00e6f\u00f0 on wurlde genoge welen & \u00e6hte, & lichames h\u00e6le, & sum yfel For \u00fean h\u00e6f\u00f0 ure Drihten gety\u00f0ed \u00fean gode mannen wele & \u00e6hte, \u00fe\u00e6t heo mugen on nytt beteon \u00fe\u00e6t & for \u00fean God gyf\u00f0 \u00fean gode mannen mihte, \u00fe\u00e6t heo gefor\u00f0igen \u00fe\u00e6t god \u00fe\u00e6t heo beginne\u00f0, \u00e6rest for & eft \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 sume yfele m\u00e6nn, \u00fee by\u00f0 swy\u00f0e byrstige & unfere, for \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t heo understanden beo Hwu",
